  Slug: sheriff
  DisplayName: Sheriff
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You hold an official title of sheriff or deputy in a small community.
    Those that would do harm to others flee your gaze, for they know it brings the
    promise of castigation. You protect your town, watch over those who have placed
    their trust in you, and make sure those that would do others harm are brought
    to justice. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Intimidation skill
    and the Hunting Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group
    Coercion] skill feat.
